cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below, and credit the source data to DGBGTH / ONAGRI (see LICENSE-DATA)."
title: "DamLevels-Data: daily storage of Tunisia's 36 large dams, 2014-2025"
type: dataset
version: 1.1.2
date-released: 2026-10-11
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23304326  # concept DOI on Zenodo (all versions)
authors:
  - family-names: "Nasfi"
    given-names: "Mohamed Hamza"
    affiliation: "MUST University, TanitData"
  - family-names: "Boulares"
    given-names: "Soura"
    affiliation: "MUST University, TanitData"
  - family-names: "Gasmi"
    given-names: "Tarek"
    affiliation: "DataDoIt, TanitData"
abstract: >-
  Provenance-traced reconstruction of the daily DGBGTH dam bulletins published
  by ONAGRI (July 2014 to October 2025): 129,390 storage observations for 36
  dams, qualified inter-dam transfer facts, dam metadata and capacity regimes,
  QA results, and GIS layers. Values are extracted from the PDF text layer and
  vector rulings by deterministic engines (no OCR) and every row links to its
  source bulletin. Licences differ by part (full terms in LICENSE-DATA):
  tables, QA, provenance, docs and ontology CC BY 4.0; source values under the
  Tunisian Licence Nationale de Données Publiques Ouvertes; the catchment and
  natural-network GIS layers and the overview map CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  (non-commercial, derived from FABDEM and MERIT Hydro); code MIT.
keywords:
  - Tunisia
  - dams
  - reservoir storage
  - hydrology
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0  # tables; GIS catchments/natural network and map: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, see license-url
license-url: "https://github.com/tanitdata/DamLevels-Data/blob/main/LICENSE-DATA"
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Situation des barrages (daily bulletins)"
    authors:
      - name: "Direction Générale des Barrages et des Grands Travaux Hydrauliques (DGBGTH)"
    publisher:
      name: "Observatoire National de l'Agriculture (ONAGRI)"
    url: "https://www.onagri.nat.tn/Situation-des-barrages/fr/19"
    license-url: "https://catalog.agridata.tn"
